#
# Unroutable pin: nand4_1's B pin (0.24 x 0.24 um at x 1.96-2.20) has no
# vertical routing track through it and no room to be widened to one
# without breaking M1.b. Place-and-route leaves it unconnected on some
# placements, which Netgen reports as a split net. The rest of the
# library covers the same logic with nand2/nand3 + and gates.
sg13g2_hv_nand4_1
